@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-43 Adjust Stock (IN/OUT/ADJUST)

class "Admin Inventory UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "InventoryController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "InventoryService" as Service <<service>>
class "ShoeDetail" as ShoeDetail <<domain>>
class "StockMovement" as StockMovement <<domain>>
class "ColorVariant" as ColorVariant <<domain>>
class "SizeStock" as SizeStock <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : POST /inventory/adjust
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> ShoeDetail : uses
Service --> StockMovement : uses
Service --> ColorVariant : uses
Service --> SizeStock : uses

note right of UI
UC-43 - Adjust Stock (IN/OUT/ADJUST)
Actors: Admin, Manager
Pre: Đang xem inventory
Post: Stock được cập nhật, stock movement được ghi
end note
@enduml
